WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.058
Last year my family moved from New York City to Miami.

2
00:00:10.059 --> 00:00:15.085
I like my new city, but I miss my old one.

3
00:00:15.086 --> 00:00:19.141
In Miami I have two new friends.

4
00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:22.601
Their names are Maria and Nicole.

5
00:00:22.602 --> 00:00:26.719
We have lots of fun together.

6
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:30.487
In New York I had a best friend.

7
00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:34.133
Her name was Chloe.

8
00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:39.392
I miss Chloe a lot.

9
00:00:39.393 --> 00:00:45.541
In Miami I live in a big new house.

10
00:00:45.542 --> 00:00:50.554
I have a bedroom all to myself.

11
00:00:50.555 --> 00:00:55.359
In New York I lived in a small apartment.

12
00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.679
I shared a room with my sister.

13
00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.744
Sometimes I miss sharing a room with her.

14
00:01:02.745 --> 00:01:07.439
We talked and laughed all night.

15
00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:12.961
In Miami there is a sandy beach near my house.

16
00:01:12.962 --> 00:01:19.649
I often go swimming with Maria and Nicole.

17
00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:24.808
In New York there was a huge park near my apartment.

18
00:01:24.809 --> 00:01:27.623
I loved it when it snowed.

19
00:01:27.624 --> 00:01:31.948
I miss sledding in the park with Chloe.

20
00:01:31.949 --> 00:01:35.778
In Miami it never gets cold.

21
00:01:35.779 --> 00:01:43.987
So I never have to wear a coat or mittens.

22
00:01:43.988 --> 00:01:49.422
In New York it gets very cold in the winter.

23
00:01:49.423 --> 00:01:56.080
I had to wear thick, warm clothes.

24
00:01:56.081 --> 00:02:02.945
In New York I lived with my mom, dad, and older sister.

25
00:02:02.946 --> 00:02:05.627
We all moved to Miami.

26
00:02:05.628 --> 00:02:07.806
We still live together.

27
00:02:07.807 --> 00:02:11.701
We still have a wonderful family.

28
00:02:11.702 --> 00:02:18.496
I guess some things never change.

